Usage: 3CCFGCLI [COMMAND]

Commands:
  /? or /H
    Display this help screen.

  LIST
    Detect and display 3C509 and 3C509B adapters.

  SAVECONFIG [/OUTPUTFILE:file] [/EXECFILE:program]
    Export all adapter configurations to a restore batch file.
